  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Guy Fawkes Night, also called Guy Fawkes Day, Bonfire Night or Fireworks Night, is an annual commemoration on 5 November, mainly in Great Britain.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383991104:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "According to the article, a local ban on fireworks in 1843 was largely ignored, and attempts to suppress the celebrations led to violent protests and several injured police constables.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383991104:66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Towards the end of the 18th century, children began begging for money with effigies of Guy Fawkes, and 5 November gradually became known as Guy Fawkes Day.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1383991104:8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The event was founded on 5 November 1605 and is associated with the United Kingdom.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q844844:P571",
        "wd:Q844844:P17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "Readers also turned to the Guy Fawkes article, which drew 133,874 readers.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Guy_Fawkes:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:52Z",
      "text": "On 5 November 2026, 136,878 people read the English article, about 110 times the usual level.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Guy_Fawkes_Night:2026-11-05",
        "views:en:Guy_Fawkes_Night:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English, the most readers were in Russian, with 3,190.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Guy_Fawkes_Night:2026-11-05",
        "views:ru:Ночь_Гая_Фокса:2026-11-05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-05T00:01:06Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, though a language is not the same as a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:ru:Ночь_Гая_Фокса:2026-11-05",
        "views:ja:ガイ・フォークス・ナイト:2026-11-05",
